{"ordinal":14028,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452610400258","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Death_011bfe5","source":"BigLebowski: Спасибо тебе…","target":"BigLebowski: Mulțumesc…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14029,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452610400257","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Death_0d31891","source":"BigLebowski: Хах, я думала, что я это сделаю с собой сама…","target":"BigLebowski: Ha, credeam că o să-mi fac asta singură…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14030,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452610400256","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Ears_DontShoot_02cd283","source":"BigLebowski: Ааааа, да похер…","target":"BigLebowski: Aaa, mi se rupe…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14031,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452606205963","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Ears_DontShoot_04f7e4e","source":"BigLebowski: Почему они принимают такое решение за них?..","target":"BigLebowski: De ce hotărăsc ei asta în locul lor?..","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14032,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452606205962","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Ears_DontShoot_04398fc","source":"BigLebowski: А вдруг им это не нужно?","target":"BigLebowski: Și dacă ele nu vor?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14033,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452606205961","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Ears_DontShoot_0245061","source":"BigLebowski: Не понимаю, зачем некоторые родоки прокалывают своим годовалым дочкам уши?","target":"BigLebowski: Nu înțeleg de ce unii părinți le găuresc urechile fetițelor de un an.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14034,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452606205960","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Photo_DontShoot_0fee5ca","source":"BigLebowski: Ах да, мне поставили эти дурацкие брекеты…","target":"BigLebowski: A, da, mi-au pus aparatul ăla dentar nenorocit…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14035,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452606205959","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Photo_DontShoot_0f7d719","source":"BigLebowski: Интересно, что изменилось…","target":"BigLebowski: Mă întreb ce s-a schimbat…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14036,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452606205958","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Photo_DontShoot_0c39982","source":"BigLebowski: У нас есть семейный альбом. Я часто смотрела на свои фотки до начала школы, и я там всегда так много улыбалась.","target":"BigLebowski: Avem un album de familie. Mă uitam des la pozele mele de dinainte să încep școala și acolo zâmbeam mereu atât de mult.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14037,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452606205957","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Armpit_DontShoot_0490212","source":"BigLebowski: Ещё одна такая выходка, и я уйду нахер.","target":"BigLebowski: Încă o fază de-asta și mă car dracului.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14038,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452606205956","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Armpit_DontShoot_0b83b6d","source":"BigLebowski: Ты ебанутый.","target":"BigLebowski: Ești futut la cap.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14039,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452606205955","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Eyes_DontShoot_0cbee9f","source":"BigLebowski: Разве не насрать? Главное, что глаза видят…","target":"BigLebowski: Ce dracu’ mai contează? Important e că ochii văd…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14040,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452606205954","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Eyes_DontShoot_0ad59cb","source":"BigLebowski: О какой же глупости они вообще заботятся…","target":"BigLebowski: Pentru ce prostie își mai fac griji și ei…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14041,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452606205953","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Eyes_DontShoot_01b1fd5","source":"BigLebowski: Знаешь, у меня в классе были девчонки, которые говорили, что в зависимости от их настроения меняется цвет их глаз.","target":"BigLebowski: Știi, aveam în clasă fete care ziceau că li se schimbă culoarea ochilor în funcție de dispoziție.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14042,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452606205952","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Hands_DontShoot_02802a3","source":"BigLebowski: Я, пожалуй, пасану.","target":"BigLebowski: Eu zic pas.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14043,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452602011658","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Hands_DontShoot_0126296","source":"BigLebowski: Ага, прикол, конечно…","target":"BigLebowski: Da, mare glumă, sigur…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14044,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452602011657","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Hands_DontShoot_0c6ee7c","source":"BigLebowski: …","target":"BigLebowski: …","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14045,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452602011656","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Hands_DontShoot_0450788","source":"BigLebowski: Найти мужа, от которого родишь ребёночка!","target":"BigLebowski: Să-ți găsești un soț cu care să faci un copilaș!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14046,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452602011655","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Hands_DontShoot_09ec4c7","source":"BigLebowski: …","target":"BigLebowski: …","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14047,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452602011654","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Hands_DontShoot_09a4d3a","source":"BigLebowski: Ведь самое главное в жизни, знаешь, что?","target":"BigLebowski: Fiindcă știi ce contează cel mai mult în viață?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14048,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452602011653","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Hands_DontShoot_0c1f247","source":"BigLebowski: Короче, пофиг…","target":"BigLebowski: În fine, mi se rupe…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14049,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452602011652","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Hands_DontShoot_094e74c","source":"BigLebowski: А я что могу сделать, если у меня аллергия? Типа, я контролирую это высыпание на коже…","target":"BigLebowski: Și ce pot eu să fac dacă am alergie? De parcă pot controla erupția asta de pe piele…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14050,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452602011651","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Hands_DontShoot_01d66f6","source":"BigLebowski: Меня мама всегда ругала за руки. Говорила, что нужно быть больше похожей на девочку.","target":"BigLebowski: Mama mă certa mereu pentru mâinile mele. Zicea că trebuie să semăn mai mult cu o fată.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14051,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452602011650","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Teeth_DontShoot_0f0e5e8","source":"Надоело уже…","target":"M-am săturat deja…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14052,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452602011649","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:BigLebowski_Teeth_DontShoot_0997501","source":"BigLebowski: В следующий раз стреляй сразу. Я не буду тебя молить о пощаде. Мне как-то похер.","target":"BigLebowski: Data viitoare trage direct. N-o să te implor să mă cruți. Mi se cam rupe.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-358.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
